#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/numpy/basics/dtypes.rst:93
msgid ""
"The ``uint16`` / ``int16`` row promotes straight to ``float`` because "
":mod:`numpy` on the camera has no 32-bit integer dtype."
msgstr ""
"``uint16`` / ``int16`` 这一行会直接提升为 ``float``\\ ，因为摄像头上的 :mod:`numpy` 没有 32 位整型"
" dtype。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/numpy/basics/dtypes.rst:97
msgid ""
"When a binary operator has a Python scalar on one side, the scalar is "
"converted to a single-element array of the *smallest* suitable dtype: "
"``123`` becomes a ``uint8`` array, ``-1000`` becomes ``int16``, a Python "
"``float`` becomes ``float``."
msgstr ""
"当二元运算符的一侧是 Python 标量时，该标量会被转换为 *最小* 合适 dtype 的单元素数组：\\ ``123`` 变为 ``uint8`` "
"数组，\\ ``-1000`` 变为 ``int16``\\ ，Python ``float`` 变为 ``float``\\ 。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/numpy/basics/dtypes.rst:104
msgid "Integer overflow wraps"
msgstr "整数溢出会回绕"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/numpy/basics/dtypes.rst:106
msgid ""
"Operations on two arrays of the same integer dtype keep that dtype, *even "
"when the result overflows*. The carry is silently dropped::"
msgstr "对两个相同整型 dtype 的数组进行运算会保持该 dtype，\\ *即使结果溢出也是如此*\\ 。进位会被静默丢弃：："

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/numpy/basics/dtypes.rst:114
msgid "Output::"
msgstr "输出：："

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/numpy/basics/dtypes.rst:118
msgid ""
"The result is ``300 mod 256 == 44``. When an intermediate needs more range "
"than the input dtype allows, cast first::"
msgstr "结果为 ``300 mod 256 == 44``\\ 。当某个中间值需要比输入 dtype 所允许的更大范围时，请先进行转换：："

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/numpy/basics/dtypes.rst:124
msgid ""
"This rule applies to every integer operator -- ``+``, ``-``, ``*``, ``//``, "
"``%``, ``&``, ``|``, ``^``. Float arrays never overflow (they promote to "
"infinity instead), so the cast trick is only needed in the integer case."
msgstr ""
"此规则适用于每一个整数运算符 —— ``+``\\ 、\\ ``-``\\ 、\\ ``*``\\ 、\\ ``//``\\ 、\\ ``%``\\ "
"、\\ ``&``\\ 、\\ ``|``\\ 、\\ ``^``\\ 。Float "
"数组永远不会溢出（它们会改为提升为无穷大），所以只有在整数情形下才需要这个转换技巧。"
